#: ../../source/docs/common-djirs2-gimbal.rst:7
#: 98b86338d6ee497eb3385d13b95da8e8
msgid "DJI RS2 and RS3-Pro Gimbals"
msgstr "DJI RS2 和 RS3-Pro 云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-djirs2-gimbal.rst:12
#: 85c7ee6d9cab4b5bb53da63de8cf1da3
msgid ""
"ArduPilot 4.4 (and higher) support the `DJI RS2 "
"<https://www.dji.com/rs-2>`__ and `DJI RS3-Pro "
"<https://www.dji.com/jp/rs-3-pro>`__ handheld gimbals using a :ref:`Lua "
"script <common-lua-scripts>`.  The driver relies on the gimbal supporting "
"the \"DJI R SDK\" protocol which is only these two gimbals as far as we "
"know.  Other gimbals including the very similar RSC2 and RS3 are not "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 4.4（及更高版本）通过 :ref:`Lua脚本 <common-lua-scripts>` 支持 `DJI RS2 "
"<https://www.dji.com/rs-2>`__ 和 `DJI RS3-Pro "
"<https://www.dji.com/jp/rs-3-pro>`__ 手持云台。该驱动依赖云台支持「DJI R "
"SDK」协议，据我们所知仅这两款云台支持该协议。其他云台包括非常相似的RSC2和RS3均不受支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-djirs2-gimbal.rst:14
#: c2c6b8306d954e1e8740a519f1b4537b
msgid ""
"Some images on this page are from the DJI SDK Protocol and User Interface "
"instructions."
msgstr "本页部分图片来自DJI SDK协议和用户界面说明文档。"

