#: ../../source/docs/common-djirs2-gimbal.rst:39
#: a6b20ffa18684b48ba3cb9dd8c76fced
msgid ""
"If using CAN1, set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 10 "
